  {"comment": "SPDX-License-Identifier: MIT"},
  {"comment": "A design for tools/ui-scripts/drawing-many-warnings.mitcad-ui (mitcad#2507, GitHub mitcad/Mitcad#694): a base view that keeps many occurrences that are gone, one warning each. Plate, a 40 x 30 x 5 body, placed 60 times in a grid 50 mm by 40 mm apart (Plate:1 to Plate:60); Drawing1 (D1, A3) has their top view (view 1) at 1:20 with its middle at (150, 150); then Plate:2 to Plate:50 deleted: the view keeps 49 occurrences that are gone. All geometry is synthetic."},
  {"cmd": "create_component", "name": "Plate"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.create"},
  {"cmd": "sketch.add_rectangle", "sketch": "F1", "corner": [0, 0], "width": 40, "height": 30},
  {"cmd": "add_feature", "def": {"type": "extrude", "profiles": [{"sketch": "F1", "region": "r{c1[c4,c2],c2[c1,c3],c3[c2,c4],c4[c3,c1]}"}],
